  "description": "dotnet new templates for Solhigson projects. solhigson-web: a layered solution (Domain, Application, Infrastructure, Web, Tests) on Solhigson.Framework.Core, Solhigson.Analyzers and Solhigson.Testing. Its host is composed from one partial per feature (logging with redaction of classified values, settings, authentication required everywhere but /alive, Hangfire from the framework, the status and deploy verbs), with Queues constants and message catalogues in Domain. Its test project inherits every Solhigson.Testing census, runs a Tier=Postgres pool test, and captures a TRX on every run, and a hang dump when a test hangs for ten minutes. Its GitHub workflows are a sharded suite gate selecting tests by the diff, a nightly full suite, a release keeping one artifact per sha and a deploy that refuses a sha without a green push-to-main gate run. The SDK is pinned in global.json, package versions are central, every project restores from its lock file in locked mode, NuGet audits every package, warnings are errors and every analyzer category is at warning.",
